  "title": "United Contractors Announces R.E.A.L. Safety Award Winners",
  "summary": "UCON’s Safety Awards Program recognizes excellence in jobsite safety, leadership, and innovation across California’s union construction industry.Safety is more than a priority—it's the foundation of every successful construction project. United Contractors (UCON) announces the recipients of its 2025 R.E.A.L. Safety Awards, honoring the companies, projects, and safety professionals whose leadership continues to raise the standard for jobsite safety across California's union construction industry.",
